    "examTrap": "Remember that the sign of the full intersection $\\mathbb{P}(\\bigcap_{i=1}^n A_i)$ is $(-1)^{n-1}$. For $n=2$, it's negative $(-)$; for $n=3$, it's positive $(+)$; for $n=4$, it's negative $(-)$."
